stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Loading: mount
  Loading --> Ready: current valid response
  Ready --> Ready: select or clear basis locally
  Ready --> Loading: explicit refresh
  Failed --> Loading: explicit retry
  Loading --> Ready: basis survives refresh
  Loading --> Ready: vanished basis resets with status
  Loading --> Failed: rejected or malformed response
  Loading --> Loading: stale completion ignored
  Ready --> Ready: stale completion ignored
  Failed --> Failed: stale completion ignored
  Loading --> Disposed: auth retirement or dispose
  Ready --> Disposed: auth retirement or dispose
  Failed --> Disposed: dispose
  Disposed --> Disposed: late completion ignored
